// RA1 fixture: the arsenal of the small two sided world (schema version 2). The engineer is
// trained by any barracks of either side (a prerequisite group, both owner sides); the sniper is
// the special of country alpha and needs any radar; the raider is forbidden to alpha (as the
// Harrier is to Korea); the militia is a Soviet unit without prerequisites, so that only the
// side of the barracks decides; the prototype cannot be queued (tech level -1) and the advanced
// trooper lies above the fixture's tech level 5; the turret has no owner sides and needs any
// barracks; the storm device is a superweapon. Fixture data (invariant I10).
